  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: New Zealand research vessel "Monowai". Year of discovery: 1984. History: Named from the Royal New Zealand Navy research vessel HMNZS "Monowai" that surveyed this feature. The term Monowai is a compound of the Greek 'mono' (lit. 'one') and the Maori 'wai' (lit. 'water')."""@en ;
