  <http://example.org/example> """Additional information: Taken from NIWA 1:1,000,000 "Esperance" sheet. A N-S aligned approx. 2 km long narrow depression in the central Kermadec Trench. The bottom of the feature rises from 10000 m to 8000 m before the sides broaden and flatten out. Minimum depth (m): 8000. Maxi"""@en ;
