  <http://example.org/example> "GEBCO: associated meeting, proposer and year of proposal: Associated meeting: SCUFN-31. Proposer: Japanese Committee on Undersea Feature Names (JCUFN). History: 2018."@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> "GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Research vessel DSSV Pressure Drop. Year of discovery: 2020. History: Named after the Italian composer Claudio Monteverdi (1567–1643). He is considered a crucial transitional figure between the Renaissance and Baroque periods of music history and was a pioneer in the development of opera."@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Vietnamese survey vessel "883". Year of discovery: 2010. History: Named from the locality of Cam H?i, district of Cam Lam, province of Khanh Hoa, Viet Nam."""@en ;
