  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Indonesian Navy Survey Ship "KRI Rigel 933". Year of discovery: 2022. History: Named after Martha Christina Tiahahu (1800-1818), a female Indonesian national hero from the Maluku Islands. When she died, her body was thrown into the Banda Sea by the then colonialists."""@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Japanese research vessel "Yokosuka". Year of discovery: 1996. History: Imeungs is the old name of Ngaremlengui State, in the nearby Babeldaob Island, Palau."""@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Japanese survey vessel "Takuyo". Year of discovery: 1995. History: The Godzilla Megamullion science team gave 14 names for the individualtopographic elements of the Godzilla Megamullion, such as "West ArmRidge", imitating the body parts of Godzilla. Since this feature is a conicalbathymetric high in the northern part, i.e., the top part, of the GodzillaMegamullion, the science team gave it the name "Head Peak"."""@en ;
