  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Korean research vessel "Busan 802". Year of discovery: 1985. History: Wangdol means "great stone" in Korean language. Wangdolcho ("cho" means "reef") was initially named in the first edition of the Korea Coast Pilot in 1990. Since that time, W"""@en ;
