  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery:  Brazil. History: 2019.","Discoverer: French research and supply vessel ""Marion Dufresne"". Year of discovery: 2011. History: Named from ""Gamma Crucis"", the third-brightest star of the South Cross constellation (Cruzeiro do Sul, in Portuguese) in the southern hemisphere, in association with the nearby Cruzeiro do Sul Rift. Gamma Crucis is a bright red giant star located at the northern point of the crossbar of the South Cross, when facing south.""""@en ;
