  <http://example.org/example> """General information: Origin of Name
Named after Yuriy Georgiyevich Kiselev (1926-2000), Russian Doctor of Geology and Mineralogy. From  1961, he worked for the Russian Navy Hydrographic Service and participated in 27 expeditions in the Arctic"""@en ;
