  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: New Zealand research vessel "Endeavour". Year of discovery: 1967. History: Named from the nearby Campbell Island ("Motu Ihupuku" in Maori language), New Zealand. This dual name reflects that of the associated land feature, Campbell Island / Motu Ihupuku, which was made official in the New Zealand Ngai Tahu Claims Settlement Act 1998."""@en ;
